#
# winoracle (WARP, FL 11_0), x64, 2026-09-28. The x86 build returns the same
# HRESULT on every line; its GetDesc leaves runtime stack garbage in the union
# words the dimension does not use (undefined words -- compare only the used
# fields on x86).
#
# Verdicts for Vitreo build of 2026-09-27 23:22 (x64 and x86 identical):
#  - srv1/rtv1/uav1 lines: Vitreo's View vtables have 9 slots, so GetDesc1
#    (slot 9) is NULL -> guest branch to 0 (probe prints GetDesc1-slot-NULL).
#  - lifetime: Windows views do NOT add to the resource's public refcount
#    (2 1 / release app ref -> 0 while the view keeps it alive); Vitreo 3 2 / 1.
#  - uav NULL tex2darr / cube: Windows TEXTURE2DARRAY {0,0,N}; Vitreo TEXTURE2D.
#  - uav 2DARRAY GetDesc: Vitreo reports FirstArraySlice/ArraySize as 0,0.
#  - typeless view formats (NULL desc / TYPELESS / UNKNOWN over a typeless
#    resource, BC1_TYPELESS, R24G8_TYPELESS): Windows E_INVALIDARG; Vitreo S_OK.
#  - D* formats as SRV (20/40/45/55) and D32 as RTV: Windows E_INVALIDARG; Vitreo S_OK.
#  - sRGB UAV (texture and buffer): Windows E_INVALIDARG; Vitreo S_OK.
#  - UAV R32_UINT/SINT/FLOAT of 32bpp typeless (spec 5.3.9.5): Windows S_OK;
#    Vitreo E_INVALIDARG.
#  - SRV 2DMSARRAY ArraySize -1, CUBEARRAY any First2DArrayFace / NumCubes -1:
#    Windows S_OK; Vitreo E_INVALIDARG.
#  - 2DMS/2DMSARRAY views of a 1-sample resource (SRV/RTV/DSV): Windows S_OK;
#    Vitreo E_INVALIDARG.
#  - structured buffer SRV/UAV NULL desc: Windows S_OK {UNKNOWN,BUFFER,0,32};
#    Vitreo E_INVALIDARG. Structured + typed format: Windows E_INVALIDARG;
#    Vitreo S_OK. Typed buffer R32_TYPELESS / sRGB: Windows E_INVALIDARG;
#    Vitreo S_OK.
#  - format-mismatch / unsupported-format refusals: Windows E_INVALIDARG;
#    Vitreo E_NOTIMPL (0x80004001).
#  - BUFFEREX flags 2: Windows S_OK and echoes 2; Vitreo E_NOTIMPL.
#  - R32G32B32_* typed buffer SRV: Windows S_OK (required); Vitreo E_NOTIMPL.
#  - DSV READ_ONLY_STENCIL on D32/D16: Windows E_INVALIDARG; Vitreo S_OK.
#  - uav 3D bad window with ppView NULL: Windows E_INVALIDARG; Vitreo S_FALSE.
#  - rtv of a buffer: Windows S_OK; Vitreo refuses the SR|RT buffer at
#    creation (area 02) and has no BUFFER RTV path.
#  - bgrx8 TYPELESS SR|RT creation: Windows S_OK; Vitreo E_INVALIDARG (area 02).
#  - cross-device resource: Windows 0x8007000e; Vitreo E_INVALIDARG (both fail).
# Every other line matches.
